ent-Autolathe = 自動車床 | autolathe
    .desc = 它使用金屬和玻璃來製作基礎物品。具備處理藍圖以印製新配方之能力。 | It produces basic items using metal and glass. Has the ability to process blueprints to print new recipes.
ent-AutolatheHyperConvection = 超對流自動車床 | hyper convection autolathe
    .desc = 一款高度實驗性的自動車床，利用極高溫的能量，以更具成本效益的方式緩慢製造物件。 | A highly-experimental autolathe that harnesses the power of extreme heat to slowly create objects more cost-effectively.
