ent-ProtolatheHyperConvection = 超對流原盤 | hyper convection protolathe
    .desc = 一款高度實驗性的原型車床，利用極端高溫的能量，以更具成本效益的方式緩慢製造物件。 | A highly-experimental protolathe that harnesses the power of extreme heat to slowly create objects more cost-effectively.
