    .desc = 為機器印刷電路板。 | Prints circuit boards for machines.
ent-CircuitImprinterHyperConvection = 超對流電路壓印機 | hyper convection circuit imprinter
    .desc = 一款高度實驗性的電路壓印機，利用極高溫的能量，以更具成本效益的方式緩慢製造物件。 | A highly-experimental circuit imprinter that harnesses the power of extreme heat to slowly create objects more cost-effectively.
ent-ExosuitFabricator = 外骨骼服製造機 | exosuit fabricator
    .desc = 生產用於機器人及其他機械需求的零件。 | Creates parts for robotics and other mechanical needs.
ent-Biofabricator = 生物方塊製造機 | biocube fabricator
    .desc = 利用生物質生產動物飼料塊。 | Produces animal cubes using biomass.
ent-SecurityTechFab = 安全科技工廠 | security techfab
    .desc = 為安保人員印製所需設備。 | Prints equipment for use by security crew.
ent-AmmoTechFab = ammo techfab | ammo techfab
    .desc = 生產任何預算有限的軍隊或軍械庫可能需要的最基本子彈數量。沒有什麼花俏的東西。 | Prints the bare minimum of bullets that any budget military or armory could need. Nothing fancy.
ent-MedicalTechFab = 醫療科技製造 | medical techfab
    .desc = 列印供醫療室使用的設備。 | Prints equipment for use by the medbay.
ent-UniformPrinter = 制服印表機 | uniform printer
    .desc = 印製新制服或替換制服。 | Prints new or replacement uniforms.
ent-Biogenerator = 生物生成器 | biogenerator
    .desc = 將植物轉化為生物質，可用於製作實用物品。 | Converts plants into biomass, which can be used to construct useful items.
ent-OreProcessor = 礦石處理器 | ore processor
    .desc = 該廠利用礦石生產薄板和錠。 | It produces sheets and ingots using ores.
ent-OreProcessorIndustrial = 工業級礦石加工設備 | industrial ore processor
    .desc = 一款專為工業應用中大量生產金屬而設計的礦石加工設備。 | An ore processor specifically designed for mass-producing metals in industrial applications.
ent-Sheetifier = sheet-meister 2000 | sheet-meister 2000
    .desc = 一台非常薄的機器。 | A very sheety machine.
ent-CutterMachine = 切割機 | cutter machine
    .desc = 這是一把切割器。它可以用來切割。用賞心悅目的圖案為您的工作檯增添多樣性吧！請勿將手指伸進去。 | This is a cutter. It cuts. Add variety to your station floor with eye-pleasing patterns! Don't stick your fingers in.
